{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39908","headline":"惜牡丹 · 徐夤","name":"惜牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日狂风揭锦筵，预愁吹落夕阳天。\n闲看红艳只须醉，谩惜黄金岂是贤。\n南国好偷夸粉黛，汉宫宜摘赠神仙。\n良时虽作莺花主，白马王孙恰少年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}